00:13:11.373 --> 00:13:16.169
razor sharp teeth and a poisonous saliva
that can kill a person within hours after a bite.

00:13:16.211 --> 00:13:21.007
These guys are so badass that they legit
have no natural predators in their native habitat,

00:13:21.049 --> 00:13:23.552
which means that these guys
are at the top of their food chain.

00:13:23.593 --> 00:13:26.471
These things move quicker than our a.k.a. Bobcat,
as we call them.

00:13:26.513 --> 00:13:29.182
These things usually pick their prey apart
when it's solo

00:13:29.182 --> 00:13:32.144
and not in a group,
but with an army of lizards like these.

00:13:32.144 --> 00:13:36.398
After three humans makes me think that these guys
are way hungrier for food than us.

00:13:36.439 --> 00:13:40.485
Now, one of the most effective things we could do
is to run away and keep running.

00:13:40.485 --> 00:13:42.195
Since attacking it head on with just

00:13:42.195 --> 00:13:45.657
our fists is a big, fat No-No,
and we don't want to waste our bombs.

00:13:45.657 --> 00:13:47.409
And the fact that these things are capable

00:13:47.409 --> 00:13:52.080
of only short bursts of explosive energy
up to 21 kilometers per hour, meaning

00:13:52.080 --> 00:13:56.585
running away from them in a zigzag pattern will be
one of the best moves to escape these things.

00:13:56.585 --> 00:13:59.504
Because these things can really only run
in a straight like pattern.

00:13:59.504 --> 00:14:00.255
And utilizing

00:14:00.255 --> 00:14:04.593
the trees around us while seemingly safe
is the exact opposite of where we want to go.

00:14:04.634 --> 00:14:09.431
Because while older commandos can't really climb
such things, well, young dragons may be nesting

00:14:09.431 --> 00:14:11.892
within the trees now,
because these dragons have followed us

00:14:11.892 --> 00:14:15.145
so far makes me think that something
is driving them to us.

00:14:15.186 --> 00:14:19.858
Because naturally, Komodo dragons only attack
if they are threatened or provoked or smell blood.

00:14:19.858 --> 00:14:22.569
And this last part is
where I think we have a serious problem

00:14:22.569 --> 00:14:27.073
because our friend over here is a drippin
attraction for these bloodsucking bastards.

00:14:27.073 --> 00:14:31.161
And he is the reason most likely
that these things are continuing to follow us.

00:14:31.202 --> 00:14:35.373
This means that we need to put an end to this now
and give the people or this lizard

00:14:35.373 --> 00:14:36.166
what they want.

00:14:36.166 --> 00:14:40.003
This dude right here,
because to them he's looking like a sick snack.

00:14:40.003 --> 00:14:45.216
If I was Sakamoto, I grab a nice rock and smash
this guy's skull and leaving him to the lizards

00:14:45.216 --> 00:14:47.969
while we find a way up this rusty piece of ladder

00:14:48.011 --> 00:14:50.263
because, let's be
honest, were outnumbered, outgunned.

00:14:50.263 --> 00:14:52.807
And our only two teammates are this dude
and this chick.

00:14:52.807 --> 00:14:56.478
And this dude's leg is not getting fixed
any time soon, at least not by us.

00:14:56.478 --> 00:15:00.106
And while we could use this guy's strength,
his injury makes him a liability.

00:15:00.106 --> 00:15:03.735
And also, let's be honest,
if you were a rambunctious teenager, gamer, nerd,

00:15:03.735 --> 00:15:06.404
and national champion,
who would you really want to save?

00:15:06.446 --> 00:15:07.155
Don't lie.

00:15:07.155 --> 00:15:11.534
Sakamoto climbs up a ladder, making the fat
guy thinks that he's leaving the unconscious girl

00:15:11.534 --> 00:15:12.827
for dead acting quickly.

00:15:12.827 --> 00:15:16.039
Sakamoto throws
a corrosive gas grenade at the dragon's location.

00:15:16.081 --> 00:15:19.250
The fat guy is confused
by how he managed to use the girl's bombs.

00:15:19.250 --> 00:15:22.754
But Sakamoto says that he used the girl's fingers
to touch the button.

00:15:22.754 --> 00:15:24.881
He tells them that they're safe
from the corrosive gas

00:15:24.881 --> 00:15:28.802
as well because of the sea breeze that morning.
They all wake up safe and sound.

00:15:28.802 --> 00:15:30.595
But something is wrong with fat guy.

00:15:30.595 --> 00:15:34.015
Suddenly, he passes out while crying out in pain
from his injured leg.

00:15:34.057 --> 00:15:36.518
They fetch some medicine for the man
pouring it on to his leg,

00:15:36.518 --> 00:15:38.686
causing him to pass out again from the shock.

00:15:38.728 --> 00:15:41.981
Later, Sakamoto confronts
the mysterious girl about how she's managed

00:15:41.981 --> 00:15:43.608
to retrieve all of her supplies

00:15:43.608 --> 00:15:47.320
He knows that she's killed a lot of people
and would only need to kill him and fat guy

00:15:47.320 --> 00:15:49.739
to gather the right amount of shards
to leave the island.

00:15:49.739 --> 00:15:53.535
Suddenly they feel someone used the sonar
and the girl tells him that she'll leave the crew

00:15:53.535 --> 00:15:54.494
to go her own way.

00:15:54.494 --> 00:15:58.748
Sakamoto tells her to not to leave and insists
that he'll act as a decoy to fight

00:15:58.748 --> 00:16:01.209
the incoming enemy. My, how nice of him.

00:16:01.209 --> 00:16:04.379
He goes to the forest and scans to find out
if the enemy is near.

00:16:04.421 --> 00:16:08.383
That's when the mystery man attacks,
forcing Sakamoto to run off the cliff side.

00:16:08.383 --> 00:16:10.260
He tries convincing the bandana man

00:16:10.260 --> 00:16:14.722
to join his crew, but a timer bomb lands
next to him and catches Sakamoto off guard.

00:16:14.764 --> 00:16:18.184
The men hold him hostage,
but Sakamoto manages to taser Mr.

00:16:18.184 --> 00:16:19.727
Overalls here and runs away.

00:16:19.727 --> 00:16:20.895
He goes back to the hideout,

00:16:20.895 --> 00:16:24.941
but Bandana Man here follows and demands
that they hand back his supplies.

00:16:24.983 --> 00:16:29.404
The fat guy tries attacking him from behind,
but gets his fingers chopped off in the process.

00:16:29.446 --> 00:16:33.616
Sakamoto rushes towards him, but bandana man
easily kicks him off of the building

00:16:33.658 --> 00:16:34.659
when he climbs back up.

00:16:34.659 --> 00:16:38.746
He sees the fat guy writhing about in pain,
and the pretty girl is nowhere to be found.

00:16:38.746 --> 00:16:39.956
Noticing her phone on the ground,

00:16:39.956 --> 00:16:44.294
he takes a look at her wallpaper and notices
a costly similar to his virtual wife.

00:16:44.294 --> 00:16:49.090
In battle, Himiko Sakamoto finds himself
outside of the enemy hideout and bandana.

00:16:49.090 --> 00:16:51.342
Man knows exactly where he's going to enter.

00:16:51.342 --> 00:16:53.803
He hide behind a door and springs out to see Mr.

00:16:53.803 --> 00:16:55.513
Overalls and step on the roof.

00:16:55.513 --> 00:16:58.308
Sakamoto makes his entrance
and sneaks into the building.

00:16:58.308 --> 00:17:02.812
He opens this door, which is concealing a hidden
bomb and manages to catch it, turning it off

00:17:02.812 --> 00:17:04.939
and saving himself from certain death.

00:17:04.939 --> 00:17:10.028
OK, we all just saw how easy it was for Bandana
Man to take us out this military style trap.

00:17:10.028 --> 00:17:12.447
Just prove to us how prepared our enemy is.

00:17:12.447 --> 00:17:13.907
However, we know a BAM

00:17:13.907 --> 00:17:18.286
bomb becomes the property of whoever disables it,
and we've only got one shot to use it.

00:17:18.328 --> 00:17:21.164
Finding the girl with our radar
shouldn't be too much of an issue.

00:17:21.206 --> 00:17:26.586
However, dealing with bandana man is the problem,
because even if we escape, we won't get very far.

00:17:26.586 --> 00:17:30.006
But in every played of armor,
there is always a chink that we could exploit.

00:17:30.006 --> 00:17:32.008
And his is Mr. Overalls.

00:17:32.050 --> 00:17:35.553
I would work on taking him out
since he is the easiest to handle.

00:17:35.553 --> 00:17:39.015
Subduing Mr.
Overalls will give us access to his bare bombs.

00:17:39.015 --> 00:17:42.560
I would knock him out and tie him up
using the shoelaces in our shoes.

00:17:42.560 --> 00:17:46.522
I then use his hands to give us access
to his bombs if that plan doesn't work.

00:17:46.564 --> 00:17:50.652
Once he wakes up, I threaten him, saying we'll
slice off one digit off of his finger

00:17:50.652 --> 00:17:55.156
and keep going until we reach the knuckle by using
the makeshift knife that we made beforehand

00:17:55.156 --> 00:17:57.700
from the broken glass
and those windows from earlier.

00:17:57.700 --> 00:18:01.663
I tell him that I will keep going on
to each finger until he's willing to cooperate.

00:18:01.704 --> 00:18:02.956
I would force him to transfer

00:18:02.956 --> 00:18:07.502
ownership of his bombs to us by making him
activate his bombs one at a time and setting them

00:18:07.502 --> 00:18:11.005
with the a maximum of time
till the bomb goes off doing this for each one.

00:18:11.005 --> 00:18:15.802
I would then manually disarm each one before the
countdown expires, allowing me to take control.

00:18:15.802 --> 00:18:18.054
And this process would take a few minutes.

00:18:18.054 --> 00:18:20.890
Since this could take a bit,
I would subdue him near a room

00:18:20.890 --> 00:18:25.561
with only one exit facing opposite of us,
and perhaps a window facing outward with a ledge

00:18:25.561 --> 00:18:29.148
to grab on to on the outskirts of that ledge
should we need to escape.

00:18:29.190 --> 00:18:33.069
This will provide us with one entrance
to pay attention to while we get a hold of Mr.

00:18:33.069 --> 00:18:33.986
Overalls Bombs.

00:18:33.986 --> 00:18:34.696
Should Mr.

00:18:34.696 --> 00:18:38.241
Bandana man show up midway
and having access to the windows

00:18:38.241 --> 00:18:42.161
as a means of escape is super necessary
in case shit hits the fan.

00:18:42.161 --> 00:18:43.830
And once we have all of Mr.

00:18:43.830 --> 00:18:45.665
Overalls bombs, we'll have an edge.

00:18:45.665 --> 00:18:48.501
But I'm not going near
Bandana man in close quarters.

00:18:48.543 --> 00:18:52.338
Once we have more than enough EMS,
we'll be able to take out Bandana Man with ease.

00:18:52.380 --> 00:18:55.466
Walking inside the room,
he finds the girl tied up on a bed

00:18:55.508 --> 00:19:00.138
Sakamoto freezer and asks if she happened
to play the character of Himiko in Batum.

00:19:00.179 --> 00:19:04.142
She says no, but Sakamoto decides
to call her by the name anyway.

00:19:04.183 --> 00:19:08.229
Meanwhile, the bad guy realizes that their hostage
has just been taken away.

00:19:08.229 --> 00:19:12.400
Mr. Overalls runs after them,
seeing glimpses of Sakamoto trying to escape.

00:19:12.442 --> 00:19:15.736
Suddenly, the bad guy runs into a trap
set up by Sakamoto.

00:19:15.736 --> 00:19:18.656
But Bandana man here has Himiko in his grip.

00:19:18.656 --> 00:19:22.452
Bandana Man challenges Sakamoto to a fistfight,
but he's not interested.

00:19:22.493 --> 00:19:25.913
Sakamoto runs out of cover,
grabbing a knife, trying to stab the man.

00:19:25.955 --> 00:19:28.249
He's pushed away,
and the man pins him to the ground.

00:19:28.249 --> 00:19:31.002
Himiko jumps on him, but is instantly thrown off.

00:19:31.002 --> 00:19:31.919
That's when Bandanna.

00:19:31.919 --> 00:19:35.423
Mann realizes that she's triggered
a gas bomb attached to his chest.

00:19:35.465 --> 00:19:39.343
The two run off and climb out of the building,
leaving Bandanna Man for dead.

00:19:39.385 --> 00:19:43.764
That night, they decide to rest up in the enemy's
hideout before meeting up with the fat guy.

00:19:43.806 --> 00:19:47.560
When they're sleeping, he Mieko notices
a ghostlike figure staring at her.

00:19:47.560 --> 00:19:50.563
She freaks out
and is certain that it wasn't her imagination.

00:19:50.605 --> 00:19:55.109
Sakamoto takes her to look for the ghost
and finds a strange room that looks lived in.

00:19:55.109 --> 00:19:58.029
Suddenly,
a hatchet wielding woman attacks him from behind

00:19:58.029 --> 00:20:01.699
but Sakamoto knocks her out
and realizes that she's missing an arm.

00:20:01.699 --> 00:20:03.159
When the ghost lady wakes up.

00:20:03.159 --> 00:20:05.453
She tells Himiko here to not trust men.

00:20:05.453 --> 00:20:11.292
But she tells that Sakamoto is different The ghost
lady explains that she was a nurse in her past

00:20:11.292 --> 00:20:15.338
life and tampered with some medical records
to protect an unlawful doctor.

00:20:15.338 --> 00:20:18.841
However, the doctor betrayed her
and put the blame onto the ghost lady.

00:20:18.883 --> 00:20:22.220
She continues by saying that both her
and the doctor were sent to the island,

00:20:22.261 --> 00:20:24.555
making it to the very end of the game together.

00:20:24.555 --> 00:20:25.848
When the time came to leave,

00:20:25.848 --> 00:20:30.770
the doctor betrayed her one final time blowing off
her arm and leaving the ghost lady for dead.

00:20:30.811 --> 00:20:33.981
She tells them that once
someone gathers the right amount of shards,

00:20:34.023 --> 00:20:36.400
a helicopter lands and takes them away to safety.

00:20:36.442 --> 00:20:39.278
Sakamoto and her amico discuss
outside the possibility

00:20:39.278 --> 00:20:44.492
of hijacking one when this happens,
but Himiko here is hiding a very important detail.

00:20:44.533 --> 00:20:48.537
OK, this ghost lady is batshit crazy
and looks the part to back it up.

00:20:48.537 --> 00:20:50.873
But she just told us a valuable piece of info.

00:20:50.873 --> 00:20:53.501
Probably the most important thing
that we've ever received

00:20:53.501 --> 00:20:57.463
because we already knew that we needed
a certain amount of crystals to leave the island.

00:20:57.463 --> 00:21:01.175
But now we know the exact method
by which they'll rescue us.

00:21:01.175 --> 00:21:04.720
And with this we can use it to prepare ourselves
for when we get rescued.

00:21:04.762 --> 00:21:09.308
The island seems to have characteristics
of what is known as an oceanic island, a.k.a.

00:21:09.308 --> 00:21:10.851
a volcanic island.

00:21:10.851 --> 00:21:13.771
This type of island is formed
by eruptions of volcanoes

00:21:13.771 --> 00:21:18.275
on the ocean floor, and this island's
flora consists of thousands of tropical trees.

00:21:18.275 --> 00:21:22.363
And that means that there is enough cover
for us to be able to spot a helicopter approaching

00:21:22.363 --> 00:21:23.864
without us being spotted.

00:21:23.864 --> 00:21:28.244
However, at this point, we don't know for sure
if the metric by which the Game Master decides

00:21:28.244 --> 00:21:32.748
who is to be rescued is solely based on the bio
indicators placed within our bodies,

00:21:32.790 --> 00:21:36.293
or if that is supplemented by surveillance
scattered throughout the island

00:21:36.293 --> 00:21:37.545
because it is very likely

00:21:37.545 --> 00:21:40.840
that there are cameras placed everywhere,
which means that we won't be able to do

00:21:40.840 --> 00:21:43.300
anything suspicious yet to outsmart them.

00:21:43.300 --> 00:21:44.885
For now, we should continue our mission

00:21:44.885 --> 00:21:48.931
with killing enough people to warrant the game
master sending a rescue helicopter.

00:21:48.973 --> 00:21:52.518
However, knowing this, I would have the gang
prepare for when that time comes.

00:21:52.518 --> 00:21:53.102
As of now,

00:21:53.102 --> 00:21:58.149
it seems highly inefficient that the only way
this game rescues its members is by helicopter.

00:21:58.149 --> 00:22:02.069
Because who's to say that would stop other members
from trying to take advantage of this

00:22:02.069 --> 00:22:05.281
and perhaps even trying to ambush the helicopter
when it arrives?

00:22:05.322 --> 00:22:09.118
I would try and make a ghost lady recall
every small detail of her story, first

00:22:09.160 --> 00:22:13.330
noting what gear and security detail
that the helicopter had on them when they arrived,

00:22:13.330 --> 00:22:17.835
including any weapons, as well as the location
of where it landed when it came to rescue them,

00:22:17.835 --> 00:22:22.423
whether that was in the exact location of where
they were or nearby at a certain drop point,

00:22:22.465 --> 00:22:26.302
more favorable to a landing helicopter,
because these details will matter

00:22:26.302 --> 00:22:29.346
and will allow us to better prepare
for when we have enough crystals

00:22:29.346 --> 00:22:31.390
to warrant a rescue team coming for us.

00:22:31.390 --> 00:22:34.226
And knowing how to prepare for
it will allow us to figure out

00:22:34.226 --> 00:22:37.646
a way to take advantage of it
when they arrive back at the old hideout.

00:22:37.646 --> 00:22:40.649
They find that
the fat guy is being treated by mystery man.

00:22:40.691 --> 00:22:44.945
He tells them that he's a doctor and that
he doesn't want to take part in the death game.

00:22:44.987 --> 00:22:49.200
Sakamoto checks his bombs and sees
that he's not even used it even once.

00:22:49.241 --> 00:22:52.203
They forgive him for being suspicious
and agree to work together.

00:22:52.244 --> 00:22:53.370
Yeah, great move.

00:22:53.370 --> 00:22:57.583
That's when they notice a supply drop nearby
and head out to go fetch supplies.

00:22:57.625 --> 00:23:00.794
Sakamoto runs towards it
and runs into sunglasses guy.

00:23:00.836 --> 00:23:04.965
Once again, they throw bombs at each other,
and Sakamoto is injured in the blast.

00:23:04.965 --> 00:23:06.258
He notices sunglasses.

00:23:06.258 --> 00:23:09.512
Guy throws a corrosive gas grenade at the doctor
and tells him to run.

00:23:09.512 --> 00:23:14.600
Sakamoto manages to catch the trunk of food and
runs away before being trapped by a flame bomb.

00:23:14.600 --> 00:23:19.271
Sunglasses guy tackles him and takes the truck
before Sakamoto is blown off of the cliff

00:23:19.271 --> 00:23:20.272
and into the ocean.

00:23:20.272 --> 00:23:24.235
He swims behind a rock, noticing
another shady man coming out of the forest.

00:23:24.235 --> 00:23:26.779
The man finds the trunk of food
and goes over to steal it.

00:23:26.779 --> 00:23:29.782
Suddenly,
a grenade activates and kills him on the spot.

00:23:29.823 --> 00:23:33.577
Sunglasses guy takes the trunk,
but Sakamoto surprises him from behind,

00:23:33.577 --> 00:23:37.706
threatening to blow him up The guy surrenders,
putting all of his belongings onto the ground.

00:23:37.748 --> 00:23:39.792
Sakamoto knows this guy is bluffing,

00:23:39.792 --> 00:23:43.545
but he doesn't know what he's up to
and tells him to turn around. But he doesn't.

00:23:43.587 --> 00:23:48.676
But Sakamoto thinks his buddies are close by
and ignores this when he walks over to the trunk.

00:23:48.676 --> 00:23:51.011
Sunglasses, Guy activates a remote bomb.

00:23:51.011 --> 00:23:53.973
However, Sakamoto manages to avoid being blown up.

00:23:54.014 --> 00:23:57.851
OK, it's one thing to not know
what someone is capable of in a place like this,

00:23:57.851 --> 00:24:01.313
but this kid clearly knew
what sunglasses guy was capable of.

00:24:01.355 --> 00:24:06.277
Since he literally saw him do some crazy shit
before sunglasses Guy isn't your average player.

00:24:06.318 --> 00:24:09.071
He is cunning
and is prone to using traps to get his way.

00:24:09.113 --> 00:24:13.826
As we saw earlier, Sakamoto had no excuses
and should not have rushed to get his loot.

00:24:13.826 --> 00:24:17.997
This almost cost him his life,
and having him back away from his loot by itself

00:24:17.997 --> 00:24:21.750
was not enough to ensure that he didn't have any
dirty tricks up his sleeve.

00:24:21.792 --> 00:24:23.877
Sakamoto could have been a little less stupid

00:24:23.877 --> 00:24:27.881
and at the very least could have ordered
sunglasses guy to turn around and give us a spin.

00:24:27.881 --> 00:24:30.884
Seriously, this would have taken 2 seconds,
and judging from the fact

00:24:30.884 --> 00:24:35.681
that the detonator was in this guy's mouth means
that this was a rookie mistake on Sakamoto part,

00:24:35.723 --> 00:24:40.310
especially since sunglasses guy ignored Sakamoto
when he told him to turn around.

00:24:40.310 --> 00:24:44.398
Which I don't know about you,
but that would be a major red flag Sunglasses guy

00:24:44.440 --> 00:24:49.028
walks off into the forest and Koseki reappears,
telling him that he took all of the supplies

00:24:49.028 --> 00:24:50.446
and the whole thing was a failure.

00:24:50.446 --> 00:24:53.741
Back at the hideout, they try feeding the fat guy
whatever food they have left.

00:24:53.741 --> 00:24:58.370
But the doctor mentions that they need to get rid
of the lizard poison within him, or he'll die.

00:24:58.370 --> 00:25:00.956
Sakamoto and Himiko
tell the doc that they know a spa

00:25:00.956 --> 00:25:03.542
to find a medicine where Ghost's Lady was staying.

00:25:03.542 --> 00:25:04.168
And once there,

00:25:04.168 --> 00:25:08.797
the doctor finds and fills a trunk full
of medical goodies, giving it to Sakamoto to keep.

00:25:08.797 --> 00:25:09.590
But just then he

00:25:09.590 --> 00:25:14.178
Mikko comes running and telling him that there's
a bomb inside that trunk right before it goes off.

00:25:14.219 --> 00:25:16.930
This doc is a full on baddie
and threatens to kill him.

00:25:17.139 --> 00:25:19.725
But that's when Ghost Lady appears and stabs him.

00:25:19.725 --> 00:25:23.228
She then takes him a cold way,
and they find out that the doc has planted bombs

00:25:23.228 --> 00:25:24.146
all over the building.

00:25:24.146 --> 00:25:27.691
Just then the doc comes back injured as hell,
and she throws a bomb at him,

00:25:27.691 --> 00:25:31.028
but not before he activates another bomb
that flings her off of the building.

00:25:31.028 --> 00:25:35.574
He goes back inside to take out Himachal
when a grenade he throws bounces off of her boobs.

00:25:35.657 --> 00:25:38.869
Suddenly, Sakamoto comes back from the dead
and chases him down.

00:25:38.869 --> 00:25:40.871
